                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>لَا يُحِبُّ اللهَ الجَهْرَ بالسُّوْءِ مِنَ القَوْلِ اِلَّ مَنْ ظُلِمَ<note>ḥarakāt placed under šadda-s.</note>
                     </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#19v">-19v</locus>ذَلِكَ بِأَنِّ مِنْهُمْ قِسِّيْسِيْنَ وَرُهْبَاناً وَّانِّهُمْ لا يَسْتَكْبِرُوْنَ<note>ḥarakāt placed under šadda-s.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>4:148-5:82. Title of sura rubricated. Number of lines a page ranges from 10 (at the end) to 12. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s). Several words left uncompleted, rewritten in full on the following line. Mark of beginning of ǧuz’. Deletions.</note>
